    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d720">

                <pb facs="0710" n="1444" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1444"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-01-04"><hi rendition="#italic">January 4, 1896</hi></date>.
                        (Received Jan. 20.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 756.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose for your
                    information a letter from Admiral Selfridge, dated Smyrna, 25th ultimo, which
                    incloses the copy of a letter from the vali of Aleppo without date, in which the
                    latter denies that the soldiers were responsible for the burning and pillage at
                    Marash.</p>
                <p>I also inclose a copy of my response to the letter of Admiral Selfridge.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">A. W. Terrell.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>





